.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-VERSION 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-version
.Nd report and self-validate the shared Astronomicon epoch
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Cm show | status | check | align Op Ar epoch
.Op Fl c | Fl -check
.Op Fl s | Fl -strict
.Op Fl q | Fl -quiet
.Op Fl v | Fl -verbose
.Op Fl n | Fl -dry-run
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl h | Fl -help
.Nm zdots
.Fl -version
.Op Ar options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads the Imperial CalVer beacon
.Pq Pa $ZDOTDIR/VERSION
and reports or self-validates alignment across the seven Astronomicon
surfaces:
.Ql zdots ,
.Ql adots ,
.Ql vdots ,
.Ql my ,
.Ql ztranscribe ,
.Ql media-pipeline ,
and
.Ql just3ws.github.io .
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "align [epoch]"
.It Cm show
Print the beacon version
.Pq default .
.It Cm status
Print the beacon, today's
.Xr imperial-date 1 ,
and per-surface alignment.
.It Cm check
Self-validate that the beacon matches
.Ql CFFFYYY.M#
and every present surface matches the beacon.
Exits non-zero on drift.
.It Cm align Op Ar epoch
Stamp today's
.Xr imperial-date 1
.Pq or Ar epoch
into every present surface's
.Pa VERSION
file.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl c , Fl -check
Alias for
.Cm check .
.It Fl s , Fl -strict
Fail
.Cm check
if any surface
.Pa VERSION
file is absent.
.It Fl q , Fl -quiet
Suppress output during
.Cm check .
.It Fl v , Fl -verbose
Include the surface table with
.Cm show .
.It Fl n , Fl -dry-run
Preview
.Cm align
changes without writing files.
.It Fl -json
Emit machine-readable JSON status.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr imperial-date 1 ,
.Xr zdots-doctor 8
